{"text": "I had put up with a thousand small injuries from Fortunato, but when he dared to insult me, I made a promise of revenge. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You, who know my nature so well, will understand that I never said a single word of threat out loud. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I would have my revenge in the end, but it had to be done in a way that brought no risk to me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A wrong is not paid back if the avenger is punished in return, or if the wrongdoer never learns who is punishing him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So I did nothing, either in words or in actions, that made Fortunato doubt my good will toward him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I kept smiling in his face, and he did not notice that my smile now came from the thought of his ruin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fortunato, a man respected and even feared in many ways, had one weak point, his pride in his knowledge of wine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One evening during the wild days of the carnival season, I met my friend in the crowded streets at dusk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had been drinking a great deal, and he was dressed as a clown, with a striped suit and a pointed cap with bells. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I was so pleased to see him that I thought I would never stop shaking his hand.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "u", "p", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "s", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "i", "n", "j", "u", "r", "i", "e", "s", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "F", "o", "r", "t", "u", "n", "a", "t", "o", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "d", "a", "r", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "i", "n", "s", "u", "l", "t", " ", "m", "e", ",", " ", "I", " ", "m", "a", "d", "e", " ", "a", " ", "p", "r", "o", "m", "i", "s", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "r", "e", "v", "e", "n", "g", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", 